Rux.sublime-syntax is Orlo's own, written from the Rux compiler's lexer
(Compiler/Lexer/Token.cpp and Lexer.cpp) and Docs/Language.md in https://github.com/rux-lang/Rux
at revision 579a62f3bb510514e0c96a812511eebd75e9b741. Its structure follows the Rux editor
grammars https://github.com/rux-lang/SublimeText (Rux.sublime-syntax, revision
8cca62cc2cfd74a1836e479ed9d9833c7ef28428) and https://github.com/rux-lang/VSCode
(syntaxes/rux.tmLanguage.json, revision e6870254f384dba50a5cb01ada0fe2448e634c21). All three are
MIT licensed; their notices follow.

language.json and samples/ are Orlo's.

